-- PORT_NOTES (Misery_Coop_Port, tools/build_cooking.py) -- coop-adapted
-- Misery item-use DISPATCHER, coop. on_game_start (called by axr_main:104)
-- registers the actor callbacks; actor_on_item_use fans out to the per-item
-- branches -- the COOKING branch opens ui_itm_cooking. db.actor->getLocalActor
-- (client). The per-frame actor_on_update is entry-guarded for a nil local
-- actor (check_actor_backpack runs every frame). Enabled feature mods (keep_enabled):
-- cooking_mod, mutant_loot_mod, repair_mod, backpack_stash -- their handlers are
-- coop-routed (cooking UI, harvest RPC, repair UI, and the backpack world-spawn
-- RPC). The backpack branch's inv_backpack world-spawn -> mc_cooking.request_deploy
-- (server alife:create, no parent); the in-base give-back -> itemop_give. Remaining
-- feature mods stay config-DISABLED EXCEPT flashlight_mod (now ENABLED to drive the
-- headlamp beam from device_flashlight -- its alife():create sites are patched out
-- since the vanilla device_torch already exists; only enable_torch(true/false) remains).
-- sleep is handled by mc_sleep; sleepbag/tent stay disabled (no alife:create).

---------------------------------------
--	itms_manager
--
-- by Alundaio
---------------------------------
